  "description": "\"Throw that thing away and use me instead.\"   \n\nHae-in, who went out to feed a stray cat, ends up picking up Moo-jin, a blood-soaked gangster. After he silently disappears, expensive items of unknown origin start piling up in Hae-in's rooftop apartment.   \n\n\"...Are you using my house as a warehouse for stolen goods?!\" \n\nWorried about being branded an accomplice and having her career ruined, she tries to soothe her extreme anxiety with obscene acts one night. And then, Cheon Moo-jin returns. At the exact moment she least wanted to be seen. \n\n\"If you were craving dick, you should've just said so.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002560)",
